Package: tela
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, chromium
Recommends: nodejs (>= 18) | bun
Description: CLI that renders HTML files to images
 Renders an HTML file to png/jpeg/jpg using Playwright with the
 system chromium (/usr/bin/chromium). Accepts -i/--input,
 -r/--resolution (WxH, defaults to 390x844) and -o/--output.
